  <data name="AIAgents_DelegateAgent.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>واجهة سطر أوامر الوكيل CLI</value>
    <comment>{Locked="CLI"} Header for the agent CLI selector in Settings &gt; Agents &gt; Command palette. Here "agent" means an AI intelligent agent (e.g. Copilot, Claude, Gemini), not a proxy or human agent. CLI means command-line interface.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="AIAgents_DelegateAgent.HelpText" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>إنشاء علامة تبويب جديدة بواجهة CLI لوكيلك المفضّل، مع إمكانية تضمين طلب وسياق من اللوحة النشطة.
Alt+Shift+/ إدخال طلب؛ Alt+Shift+B التشغيل دون طلب أولي.</value>
    <comment>{Locked="CLI","Alt+Shift+/","Alt+Shift+B"} Agent CLI help in Settings &gt; Agents. Keep exactly one line break between the description and the shortcut reference. The UI renders the hotkeys with the same keycap style as Settings &gt; Actions. Start the description after each shortcut with lowercase where the language uses case. Context comes from the active pane; launching without an initial prompt is still interactive. Separate each hotkey and its description with a space, not a colon.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="AIAgents_AutoErrorHandlingTitle.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>اكتشاف الأخطاء</value>
    <comment>Title for the Error detection dropdown in the AI agents settings page.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="AIAgents_AutoErrorHandlingDescription.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>اكتشف الأوامر الفاشلة في واجهة الأوامر تلقائيًا، وأرسلها اختياريًا إلى وكيلك لإصلاحها تلقائيًا.</value>
    <comment>Umbrella description for the three-state Error detection setting in the AI agents settings page. The Detect errors option is local-only; only Detect and fix errors sends failures to the AI agent. Use the approved product copy verbatim. Here "agent" refers to an AI intelligent agent, not a proxy or human agent.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="AIAgents_AutoErrorHandling_Off" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>إيقاف</value>
    <comment>The third option in the Error detection dropdown. It disables automatic terminal error detection and suggestions.</comment>
