  <data name="AIAgents_ShowTokenUsageAndCost.Header" xml:space="preserve"><value>استخدام الرموز المميزة</value><comment>Header for a setting that shows available context-window usage and session cost in the terminal bottom bar. Session cost is reported for the active AI session. Keep 'session cost' generic and do not add a specific unit. Either value may be unavailable.</comment></data>
